level1 lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>YP 3.3.5 is out of QA and =
pending release approval<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l11 =
level1 lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Inclusive language changes have =
merged however there are still:<o:p></o:p></span></li><ul =
style=3D'margin-top:0in;padding-inline-start:48px' type=3Dcircle><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l11 =
level2 lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Incompatible license related =
variable changes<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l11 =
level2 lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Function variable name changes =
needed<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l11 =
level2 lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>No migration documentation or =
documentation of the changes<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l11 =
level2 lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>No documentation of the bitbake =
rename code<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l11 =
level2 lfo8;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>No updates to the manual for =
the variable renames<o:p></o:p></span></li></ul></ul><p =
style=3D'mso-margin-top-alt:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin=
-left:.5in'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;color:black'>We do need people =
to pull things together and finish things off, help in doing that is =
needed and much appreciated.</span><o:p></o:p></p><ul =
style=3D'margin-top:0in;padding-inline-start:48px' type=3Ddisc><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l2 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>There is a pending patch to =
warn about old style license identifiers pending in master-next and due =
to be posted for review. On balance this is probably a good thing to get =
into the LTS but we&#8217;re open to input on =
that.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l2 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>The incompatible license =
changes will mean anyone using those variables will need to update what =
they&#8217;re doing carefully. Patches in master-next now pass testing =
and are due to be posted on the mailing list.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l2 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>The python build process change =
to use wheels has merged. That change has caused some disruption but was =
close enough to being ready it seemed worth making the final push for =
inclusion.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l2 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>The infrastructure move was =
successful and all services should be restored. There are some =
networking issues occurring on autobuilder builds which are preventing =
release builds at this time and are being looked =
into.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l2 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>As such, the M3 release build =
will likely happen late this week or early next =
week.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l2 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>If people see intermittent =
issues in their own builds, particularly if they&#8217;re the same as =
intermittent issues seen on the autobuilder, please do comment in the =
bugs mentioning when they happen as the frequency information does help =
us prioritize fixing the most common issues.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l2 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Intermittent issues continue to =
be at record high levels and help is very much welcome in trying to =
resolve them. You can see the list of failures we&#8217;re continuing to =
see by searching for the &#8220;AB-INT&#8221; tag in bugzilla: <a =
href=3D"https://bugzilla.yoctoproject.org/buglist.cgi?quicksearch=3DAB-IN=
T"><span =
style=3D'color:#1155CC'>https://bugzilla.yoctoproject.org/buglist.cgi?qui=
cksearch=3DAB-INT</span></a><o:p></o:p></span></li></ul><p =
